<h1>Design system</h1>
<p>The real tokens this project is built from, read straight out of
<code>design/tokens.css</code>. Nothing on this page is a copy — a design system
page that restates its own values is the second copy that drifts.</p>
<h2 id="colour">Colour</h2>
<div class="swatches">
{% for t in tokens.colours %}
  <div class="swatch">
    <div class="chip" style="background: var({{ t.name }})"></div>
    <div class="label"><code>{{ t.name }}</code><br><span class="q-audience">{{ t.light }} / {{ t.dark or '—' }}</span></div>
  </div>
{% endfor %}
</div>
<h2 id="type">Type</h2>
<p style="font-family: var(--font)">Body — <code>--font</code></p>
<p style="font-family: var(--font-ui)">Interface — <code>--font-ui</code></p>
<p style="font-family: var(--font-mono)">Mono — <code>--font-mono</code></p>
<h2 id="other">Everything else</h2>
<ul class="counts">{% for t in tokens.other %}<li><code>{{ t.name }}</code> — {{ t.light }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
